{"id": "lg_display-2026-10-27-014", "date": "2026-10-27", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["lg_display", "lg_elec"], "customers": ["lg_elec"], "suppliers": ["lg_display"]}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["多公司提及", "供應鏈上下游同時提及"]}, "title": "Is LG planning to start producing 97\" and 111\" OLED panels?", "content": "<p>A report from China suggests that LG Display has signed an agreement with the state-owned Guangzhou Development Zone Holding Group (also known as Guangkai Holdings Group) to jointly invest a total of 1 billion Yuan (around $150 million USD) in a new large-area OLED module production line in Guangzhou.</p><img data-entity-uuid=\"f4a2a00a-62ea-4804-b184-7bf938e10845\" data-entity-type=\"file\" src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/inline-images/LG-Display-Guangzhou-OLED-fab_0.jpg\" heig", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/lg-planning-start-producing-97-and-111-oled-panels", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-10-27-015", "date": "2026-10-27", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Apple launches its 2026 iPad Mini tablet, with a 8.5\" AMOLED display", "content": "<p>Yesterday Apple launched its <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/apple-ipad-mini-2026\">2026 iPad Mini tablet</a>, the first one to sport an OLED display. The 8.5\" screen features &nbsp;60Hz 1512x2316 resolution and 1200 nits (HBM). The OLED is produced by Samsung Display.</p><p><img src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/inline-images/Apple-IPhone-Mini-2026.jpg\" data-entity-uuid=\"cbac4d00-33fa-4206-8433-55c590a7adb7\" data-entity-type=\"file\" width=\"567\" height=\"270\" alt=\"Apple OLED ", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/apple-launches-its-2026-ipad-mini-tablet-85-amoled-display", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-10-27-016", "date": "2026-10-27", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 44, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["weak"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Samsung Electronics and Apple reduce their OLED panel orders, and Samsung Display may see weaker Q4 profit", "content": "<p>Samsung Display may see weaker results in the fourth quarter of 2026, as its two largest customers, Apple and Samsung Electronics, are reportedly scaling back their smartphone component orders following the sharp rise in memory prices. According to industry sources, Samsung's mobile division asked its suppliers to reduce their Q4 component deliveries by 20-30% from earlier plans, while Apple cut its October orders for certain <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/apple-iphone-18-pro-18-pro-max\">", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/samsung-display-faces-q4-profit-squeeze-apple-and-samsung-electronics-cut-their", "type": "rss"}]}
